        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: King of Norway, King Magnus\n- Places: Southern Isles, this region\n- Systems: King Magnus' Halt railway station\n- Topics: Norwegian military campaigns, regional independence, British naming\n\nFacts:\n- King Magnus' Halt railway station was named after King Magnus of Norway.\n- King Magnus of Norway launched aggressive military campaigns in this region.\n- This region was at times independent of external control.\n- The British knew this region as the Southern Isles.",
